  "description": "Baek Dan-ha became Geumjang's daughter-in-law through an arranged marriage. One night, after listening to her brother-in-law Seomun Yoo-Seung's words, she went to the separate house—only to witness her husband's immoral acts.\n\n\"Sister-in-law, don’t you want to get revenge on your husband?\"\n\nSeomun Yoo-Seung quietly approaches her… after giving her such a strange suggestion.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515037563), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12268228), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/sutal), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sutal), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000068143), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250115), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/8615), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67650803) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/seized/list?title_no=8402), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dad_2000475), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000952)",
